          "SourceString": "一颗星球所铸成的武器，是真实存在的吗？\n无数次观测，无数次呼唤，无数次向它探求。\n握紧它。\n直面纷争的终局，见证静默的答案。",
          "LocalizedString": "A weapon forged from an entire planet—does it truly exist?\nCountless observations. Countless calls. Countless pleas directed toward it.\nGrip it tightly.\nFace the final clash head-on. Witness the silent answer."
