        "Desc": {
          "Namespace": "Promotion",
          "Key": "18_Desc",
          "SourceString": "我知晓的。\n金鱼游到了天空的裙边。\n花火盛放在池塘的鬓面。\n永远永远记得哦。\n这一个夏天，与你相遇，所有的耀眼。",
          "LocalizedString": "I know it well.\nGoldfish drift to the hem of the sky.\nFireworks bloom upon the pond’s reflection.\nPromise me you'll never forget—\nThis summer, every brilliance began with you."
